    {
      "id": "PPL01",
      "finding": "IngredientCount.IsFixedIngredient means its slot filter has exactly one allowed def. recipe.fixedIngredientFilter instead describes the recipe-level allowed universe. New Bill copies defaultIngredientFilter; RecipeDef initializes a missing default filter from fixedIngredientFilter. These are distinct roles.",
