    {
      "id": "PPL04",
      "finding": "Ordinary spawned ground ingredients use squared horizontal X/Z Euclidean distance from billGiver.Position, strictly less than radius squared, along with spawned, recipe/filter, forbidden and reservation checks. Traversal uses passable regions and within-region reachability; radius is not worker distance, interaction-cell distance or path length. Native multi-layer simulation is not established by this path.",
