      "id": "PPL05",
      "finding": "The region-search root is the building interaction cell, falling back to pawn.Position for a malformed building, or billGiver.Position for nonbuildings. NoMix sorts candidates by squared horizontal distance from that root. Search/sort root is therefore distinct from radius center.",
