      "id": "PPL06",
      "finding": "IHaulSource eligibility checks the spawned source container position with InHorDistOf, whose squared horizontal comparison is inclusive <=. Recursively held contents then undergo forbidden/reservation/thing checks; this is not the ordinary spawned-Thing validator. Autonomous worktables also try their own innerContainer. The ground/container boundary difference is static evidence only.",
