    {
      "id": "PPL07",
      "finding": "Native ingredient radius is float: UI slider3..100 maps >=100 to999 and displays finite values with F0. The999 sentinel disables region-distance pruning when abs(999-radius)<1 but the ordinary ground validator still applies distance<999. It is a practical unlimited label, not mathematical infinity. Integer radius and null infinity in the Web adaptation are separate design choices.",
