    {
      "id": "PPL08",
      "finding": "PawnAllowedToStartAnew immediately returns pawnRestriction==pawn when a named worker is present. Otherwise category restrictions and an inclusive user skill interval apply using recipe.workSkill and pawn skill or mech fixed level; mechanitor checks follow. Named-worker mode bypasses the user interval in this method. UI hides the0..20 range selector for a named worker or mechs-only mode.",
