      "finding": "WorkGiver_DoBill independently evaluates recipe.FirstSkillRequirementPawnDoesntSatisfy after PawnAllowedToStartAnew. Named-worker selection therefore does not bypass hard recipe skill requirements. RecipeDef iterates the declared requirements, whereas the user interval uses workSkill. Core component recipe has a Crafting8 requirement; the stone base workSkill is Crafting with learn factor0.",
