      "finding": "Worker dropdown enumerates AllMaps_FreeColonists with an optional validator and stable ordering by label, work skill, active work and incapability. Incapable work types yield disabled options; unassigned workers may be selectable with NotAssigned label. Selecting only sets the bill restriction: it does not enable work or transport a pawn. Setters clear competing named/category modes; dead, faction-changed or kidnapped named pawns are cleared by validation.",
