      "finding": "New jobs capture ingredient targets/counts. Inspected ordinary ingredient-collection and work paths do not continuously reevaluate ingredient filter, radius, named worker or user skill interval. They retain other failure conditions including destroyed/forbidden targets, unusable/deleted bill giver and explicit suspension during work. Long UFT work can check overrides. Policy edits primarily govern subsequent dispatch; absolute uninterruptibility is not claimed.",
