      "finding": "Unbound UFT search requires same recipe, same creator, all ingredient defs currently fixed-or-allowed and reservation, searching from pawn with max9999 rather than bill ingredient radius. The bound UFT continuation branch checks bound worker/reachability/reservation/forbidden without the same ingredient re-filter. Outer named-worker and recipe hard-skill checks still precede bound continuation.",
